#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Nodi yahindutse nyuma y'uko urupapuro rwerekanwe, bityo nta cyakozwe. Yisuzume maze wongere ugerageze."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Uburenganzira bwawe ku gikoresho ntibukwemerera guhindura iyi nyandiko."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Izina: indi fabric isanzwe ikoresha iri zina."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Adapter: indi fabric isanzwe ikora isuzuma kuri iyi port ya adapter kuri iyi poller. Fabric imwe kuri buri port ya adapter."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kubika fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Fabric yabitswe."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Isuzuma ry'iyi fabric ririmo gukorwa, bityo nta cyasibwe. Ongera ugerageze nirirangira."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Fabric n'urutonde rwayo rw'ibikoresho byasibwe. Nta gikoresho cya Cacti cyahinduwe kandi fabric ntiyavugishijwe."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse gusiba fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Umwirondoro wa nodi ntiwahinduwe."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Umwirondoro wa nodi wavuguruwe. Izongera gusuzumwa guhera ku cyiciro gikurikira."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Ihuza ry'igikoresho ryimuriwe kuri nodi nshya."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kwemeza icyifuzo. Birashoboka ko nodi zahindutse kuva cyakorwa."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kwanga icyifuzo."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "Icyifuzo cyanzwe."

#: fabric_admin.php
#, php-format
msgid "The node mapping was not changed. %s"
msgstr "Ihuza rya nodi ntiryahinduwe. %s"

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was not changed."
msgstr "Ihuza rya nodi ntiryahinduwe."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was saved."
msgstr "Ihuza rya nodi ryabitswe."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "No device was created. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Nta gikoresho cyaremwe. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Igikoresho cyaremwe kandi nodi yahujwe na cyo. Hitamo ama-port yo gukorera ibishushanyo ku rupapuro rwa New Graphs."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse gusoma urutonde rw'ibikoresho kugira ngo rwoherezwe hanze."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates and data query file were installed."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Fabric na dosiye y'isuzuma ry'amakuru byashyizwemo."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates were not installed. See the Cacti Objects table and the Cacti log."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Fabric ntizashyizwemo. Reba imbonerahamwe ya Cacti Objects n'inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

