#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Fabric ntizishyizwemo. Ongera uzishyiremo uvuye ku rupapuro rw'ubuzima."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Nodi isanzwe ihujwe n'igikoresho."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Fabric y'iyi nodi ntisuzumwa na poller y'ibanze, bityo igikoresho cyayo nticyashoboye gukusanywa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Igikoresho ntikibaho."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Igikoresho gikusanywa na poller itandukanye n'isuzuma iyi fabric, bityo nticyashoboye gusoma ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa fabric."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "Igikoresho \"%s\" kivuye ku nyandikorugero y'igikoresho ya %s, izina rya host %s, gikusanywa na poller %d, igenzura ry'iboneka na SNMP bifunze."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Isuzuma ry'amakuru rya %s ririho, ryerekana ama-port ya nodi. Ubwayo ntirema igishushanyo cyangwa inkomoko y'amakuru."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Cyaremwe n'umugereka wa Fabric ku bwa nodi %s. Uduciro twacyo tuva mu bubiko bw'agateganyo bw'umugereka; izina rya host ni izina ryihariwe ritavugishwa na rimwe."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Izina: koresha inyuguti kuva kuri 1 kugeza kuri 64, imibare, imyanya, utudomo, utunyerezo, cyangwa utunyerezo two hasi, utangira n'inyuguti cyangwa umubare."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Backend: choose one of the listed backends."
msgstr "Backend: hitamo imwe muri backend zatanzwe ku rutonde."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: hitamo imwe muri poller zatanzwe ku rutonde."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added."
msgstr "Poller: poller y'ibanze yonyine ni yo ishobora gusuzuma fabric kugeza igihe uburyo bwo gukoresha poller zo kure buzongerwamo."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Sweep Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Intera y'isuzuma: andika umubare wuzuye w'amasegonda kuva kuri %d kugeza kuri %d."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Adapter: enter the local adapter name as the kernel names it, such as mlx5_0."
msgstr "Adapter: andika izina rya adapter yo ku gikoresho nk'uko kernel iryita, nka mlx5_0."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Adapter Port: enter the port number of the local adapter, from 1 to %d."
msgstr "Port ya Adapter: andika nimero ya port ya adapter yo ku gikoresho, kuva kuri 1 kugeza kuri %d."

