msgstr "Ntibyashobotse gusoma urutonde rw'ibikoresho bya fabric. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Ugutegereza kwohereza kubara udukubito (ticks) aho port yari ifite amakuru yo kohereza ariko ntishobore kuyohereza, kubera kubura uburenganzira bwo kohereza (credits) cyangwa uruhushya rwo gutambuka. Agaciro kari hejuru kagaragaza umuvundo werekeza ku rundi ruhande rwa kure; ntikagaragaza ko port cyangwa umugozi wayo bifite ikibazo. Uburebure bw'agakubito ntibwatangajwe ku muvuduko w'imiyoboro ukoreshwa ubu, bityo uduciro ni udukubito ku isegonda, si igihe."

