#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Isesengura rikorwa nka root. Koresha poller kuri konti idafite uburenganzira bwose, ifite uburenganzira bwo gusoma ibikoresho bya umad binyuze mu itsinda."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Igikoresho cyo gusuzuma gifite biti ya setuid cyangwa setgid. Umugereka ntabwo uyikeneye na rimwe."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Igikoresho cyo gusuzuma cyangwa ububiko bwacyo bishobora kwandikwamo na konti itari nyirabyo, cyangwa na konti ya poller. Uwo ari we wese ushobora kubyandikamo ni we uhitamo ibyo poller ikoresha."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Igikoresho cya umad gishobora gusomwa cyangwa kwandikwaho na buri konti, bityo umukoresha uwo ari we wese wa hafi ashobora kubaza fabric. Bigene itsinda gusa."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Umuburo utazwi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Ibikoresho byo gusuzuma"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye y'ububiko, kuri buri poller isesengura fabric, irimo perfquery, ibnetdiscover, na iblinkinfo. Paki za Debian na Ubuntu zibishyira muri /usr/sbin. Nta yindi porogaramu ikorerwamo na rimwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibikoresho"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Ikarita y'amazina ya Node"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye itari itegeko ijya kuri dosiye y'ikarita y'amazina ya node ya infiniband-diags. Amazina itanga yerekanwa gusa; umwirondoro uba buri gihe ari GUID ya node."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cya Datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Umubare wa milisegonda buri datagram yo kugenzura ishobora gutwara mbere y'uko ibikoresho byongera kugerageza (ihitamo ryabyo rya -t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'itegeko"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Amasegonda igikorwa kimwe cy'igikoresho gishobora gutwara mbere y'uko gihagarikwa kandi kikandikwa nk'icyatsinzwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB igikorwa kimwe cy'igikoresho gishobora kwerekana. Ibisohoka binini kurushaho birajugunywa kandi bikandikwa nk'ibyatsinzwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Ibisohoka ntarengwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Isesengura"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cya Node"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Amasegonda isesengura rya node imwe rishobora kumara risoma ibibaruro. Port zitagerwaho zisomwa mu cyiciro gikurikira."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Umubare wa port zatsinzwe zituma isesengura rya node rihagarara muri iki cyiciro. Port itasubiza itwara amasegonda menshi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'inshuro zo gutsindwa kwa Node"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Gushyira ku rutonde Port zidakora"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Iyo bishyizweho akamenyetso, ishakisha ry'amakuru rya Fabric Port rishyiraho na port zidakora kandi zidafite aho zihurira ku rundi ruhande, nka port za adapter zidakoreshwa. Iyo bikuweho, zisigara inyuma kugeza igihe zongereye gukora."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Iyo bishyizweho akamenyetso, gukuramo umugereka kugumana fabric zayo, urutonde rw'ibikoresho, n'ingero. Bikureho kugira ngo gukuramo bibisibe; banza wohereze hanze urutonde rw'ibikoresho uvuye ku ipaji ya Fabric Admin. Nta na rimwe fabric ibazwa mu buryo bwombi."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibikoresho bugomba kuba inzira yuzuye igizwe n'inyuguti, imibare, utudomo, uturongo tugufi, uturongo duca hasi, n'udusharure, nta gasharure kari ku musozo."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibikoresho ntibubaho cyangwa si ububiko."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Inzira y'ububiko bw'ibikoresho irimo ihuza ry'ikimenyetso (symbolic link). Injiza inzira nyakuri."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibikoresho ntibutunzwe na root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibikoresho bushobora kwandikwamo n'itsinda ryabwo cyangwa n'abandi."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Igikoresho cyo gusuzuma ntikitunzwe na root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Igikoresho cyo gusuzuma gishobora kwandikwamo n'itsinda ryacyo cyangwa n'abandi."

